#
# Keep the reproducibility image lean. It needs everything `make verify-offline` /
# `make dashboard` read: src, tests, data, ledger, the Makefile, the docs the audits
# scan, site/ (the site tests and audits), docs/article/ (overstatement scope) and
# .git (the drift step runs `git diff`).
.gitignore
.github
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
build/
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store
